			"id":"99d44c7d9a1059e4",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**What happens when Blood Glucose concentration falls below normal**\n=> glucose is used up for respiration to provide energy. \n=> glucose level in blood drops. ",
			"styleAttributes":{},
